This repository is NOT an official Google project. It is an independent,
personal reproduction and learning exercise built on the public code
release of "Code as Policies: Language Model Programs for Embodied
Control" (Liang et al., 2022).

Portions of this repository are derived from:

  google-research/google-research, path code_as_policies
  https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/code_as_policies
