Specifically:

  - code_as_policies/ contains upstream files kept as-is, including the
    original notebook, README and Apache 2.0 license.
  - src/upstream_env.py is generated from cells 7-9 (0-indexed) of the
    upstream notebook by build_env.py.
  - All remaining files are local additions or adaptations. The list of
    local changes is recorded in README.md.

Simulation assets used by the upstream demo are not redistributed here.
They are fetched at setup time and verified against the SHA-256 values in
assets/manifest.json.

